    "causal_summary": "The deep-loop codex write-containment guard (`write-containment.ts`) confines a `cli-codex` leaf's writes to its artifact directory by diffing the git working tree after each dispatch: any out-of-scope path that is dirty after the dispatch but was not in the pre-dispatch baseline is treated as a leaf violation, reverted, and used to fail the iteration fail-closed",
